# Lihaaf-owned `.stderr` snapshots live in this directory (next to each
# `.rs` symlink) so `--bless` writes never touch the trybuild snapshots
# under `djogi-macros/tests/compile_fail/`. The two corpora normalize
# path prefixes differently (`tests/compile_fail/<file>` for trybuild
# vs. `$DIR/<file>` for lihaaf — see `docs/spec/lihaaf-v0.1.md` §7.2
# in the standalone lihaaf repo), so snapshot bytes diverge by design.
#
# Phase 8.5 posture: lihaaf-blessed snapshots are NOT committed. They
# are regenerated locally with
#   `cargo lihaaf --filter compile_fail --bless -j 4`
# and trybuild remains the committed source-of-truth corpus while the
# trybuild → lihaaf migration is a separate later step.
*.stderr
